-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "ffe4f4f3-37ec-5331-b8dd-d208cf268e9d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "ffe4f4f3-37ec-5331-b8dd-d208cf268e9d" :answer-field/choices "ded207fb-cb56-58eb-9a0f-d658894755b8"] [:db/add "ffe4f4f3-37ec-5331-b8dd-d208cf268e9d" :answer-field/choices "291c5943-96df-5d10-9847-480ba9dcddbb"] [:db/add "ffe4f4f3-37ec-5331-b8dd-d208cf268e9d" :answer-field/choices "bdb0dd4b-eeea-5f7c-b1ab-c6f7d800e244"] [:db/add "ffe4f4f3-37ec-5331-b8dd-d208cf268e9d" :answer-field/choices "2042cd43-aab5-5e29-bdf4-614c1ea3eff1"] [:db/add "ffe4f4f3-37ec-5331-b8dd-d208cf268e9d" :answer-field/choices "39387465-0e87-5704-a1c8-1b1ad04bbc29"] [:db/add "ffe4f4f3-37ec-5331-b8dd-d208cf268e9d" :answer-field/correct "bdb0dd4b-eeea-5f7c-b1ab-c6f7d800e244"] [:db/ensure "ffe4f4f3-37ec-5331-b8dd-d208cf268e9d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9c3d97b0-c388-5846-b671-21162ba60fb3" :question/id #uuid "9c3d97b0-c388-5846-b671-21162ba60fb3"] [:db/add "9c3d97b0-c388-5846-b671-21162ba60fb3" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2^{x^{3} + 1} x^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "9c3d97b0-c388-5846-b671-21162ba60fb3" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3} + 1$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2^{x^{3} + 1} x^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int 2^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 2^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{2^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int 2^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\frac{2^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2^{x^{3} + 1}}{3 \\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "9c3d97b0-c388-5846-b671-21162ba60fb3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "9c3d97b0-c388-5846-b671-21162ba60fb3" :question/answer-fields "