ked-solution "Let $u=x^{3} + 1$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3 x^{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 \\cdot 3^{x^{3} + 1} x^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{3^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{3^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3^{x^{3} + 1}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "5b6a6f1f-4468-57c5-a6a5-2bccc4588ce3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "5b6a6f1f-4468-57c5-a6a5-2bccc4588ce3" :question/answer-fields "648fb65d-abe9-5a5f-8eb1-6a09fa6b62ea"] [:db/ensure "5b6a6f1f-4468-57c5-a6a5-2bccc4588ce3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions "5b6a6f1f-4468-57c5-a6a5-2bccc4588ce3"] [:db/add "515cf912-4b56-59d9-b7b3-94c2224fe7b0" :answer/id #uuid "515cf912-4b56-59d9-b7b3-94c2224fe7b0"] [:db/add "515cf912-4b56-59d9-b7b3-94c2224fe7b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "515cf912-4b56-59d9-b7b3-94c2224fe7b0" :answer/value "- \\frac{3 \\cdot 3^{x^{2} + 2}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C"] [:db/ensure "515cf912-4b56-59d9-b7b3-94c2224fe7b0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d6d9b23d-b143-5ea6-9cf6-add19c52554b" :answer/id #uuid "d6d9b23d-b143-5ea6-9cf6-add19c52554b"] [:db/add "d6d9b23d-b143-5ea6-9cf6-add19c52554b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d6d9b23d-b143-5ea6-9cf6-add19c52554b" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\cdot 3^{x^{2} + 2}}{4 \\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C"] [:db/ensure "d6d9b23d-b143-5ea6-9cf6-add19c52554b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3c453b09-77db-5288-81ed-d0142351a39b" :answer/id #uuid "3c453b09-77db-5288-81ed-d0142351a39b"] [:db/add "3c453b09-77db-5288-81ed-d0142351a39b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3c453b09-77db-5288-81ed-d0142351a39b" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\cdot 3^{x^{2} + 2}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C"] [:db/ensure "3c453b09-77db-5288-81ed-d0142351