3 \\cdot 3^{x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "35b4f45d-5d8d-5022-a323-571d675b96e8" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{2} + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 \\cdot 3^{x^{2} + 2} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{3^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int 3^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\frac{3^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\cdot 3^{x^{2} + 2}}{2 \\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "35b4f45d-5d8d-5022-a323-571d675b96e8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "35b4f45d-5d8d-5022-a323-571d675b96e8" :question/answer-fields "c0a45d5d-7311-52d0-a504-9c52cd7a8ccb"] [:db/ensure "35b4f45d-5d8d-5022-a323-571d675b96e8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184350 :knowledge-point/questions "35b4f45d-5d8d-5022-a323-571d675b96e8"] [:db/add "ab2954fc-e36e-5c77-a45f-c1838b4914fd" :answer/id #uuid "ab2954fc-e36e-5c77-a45f-c1838b4914fd"] [:db/add "ab2954fc-e36e-5c77-a45f-c1838b4914fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ab2954fc-e36e-5c77-a45f-c1838b4914fd" :answer/value "\\frac{5^{x^{3}}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C"] [:db/ensure "ab2954fc-e36e-5c77-a45f-c1838b4914fd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8ffb7ee0-d72d-5393-b215-b516541d8bb9" :answer/id #uuid "8ffb7ee0-d72d-5393-b215-b516541d8bb9"] [:db/add "8ffb7ee0-d72d-5393-b215-b516541d8bb9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8ffb7ee0-d72d-5393-b215-b516541d8bb9" :answer/value "\\frac{5^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C"] [:db/ensure "8ffb7ee0-d72d-5393-b215-b516541d8bb9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "46989eee-c378-5ce0-9a62-e7e22c163257" :answer/id #uuid "46989eee-c378-5ce0-9a62-e7e22c163257"] [:db/add "46989